                                             BUSINESS QUESTION
Does higher trading volume lead to bigger stock price movement?

            Query 
SELECT
    name,
    volume,
    ROUND(close - open,2) AS price_movement
FROM stock_data
ORDER BY volume DESC;

          Insight:
This analysis shows that higher trading volume  don’t always  lead to higher movement in our stock price, meaning investor activity alone does not fully
determine market price direction

     Recommendation:
The company should combine trading activity analysis with volatility and price trend monitoring before making investment decisions.

